OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners to lobby new council
OL,4,Aon cemetery future
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners calling for better
OL,7,Frecognition of a cemetery where
OL,8,Fthousands of people are buried say they
OL,9,Fwill lobby a new council for change
OL,10,Fwhen it takes over.
OL,12,FThe Friends of Horton Cemetery is
OL,13,Fcalling for the privately owned site,
OL,14,Fwhere up to 9,000 people are buried, to
OL,15,Fbe brought into public ownership and to
OL,16,Fserve as a memorial.
OL,18,FThe site in Epsom was used for burials
OL,19,Fbetween 1899 and 1955, when it was
OL,20,Fbetween five psychiatric hospitals
OL,21,Fknown as the Horton Estate.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
