OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners to lobby new council
OL,4,Aon cemetery future
OL,5,
OL,6,FLionel Blackman, secretary of the
OL,7,FFriends group, said the organisation
OL,8,Fwould "lobby a fresh-thinking team" on
OL,9,Fthe new East Surrey Council, due to
OL,10,Ftake over in April, regarding a
OL,11,Fcompulsory purchase order.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
